OL,3,GNEWSA'We're going through half a kilo
OL,4,Aof rat poison a week'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses are urging the council to do
OL,7,Fmore after fly-tipping led to a rat
OL,8,Finfestation close to food manufacturers
OL,9,Fand an after-school club.
OL,11,F"Several tonnes" of rubbish have been
OL,12,Fdumped on land on the corner of Carter
OL,13,FStreet and Granby Street on the
OL,14,Foutskirts of Bradford city centre,
OL,15,Faccording to one business owner who
OL,16,Fsaid he was currently using "half a
OL,17,Fkilo of rat poison a week".
OL,19,FMatt Langford, owner of Cartec of
OL,20,FBradford, said the fly-tipping started
OL,21,Fin the spring and attracted rats and
OL,22,Fcaused foul smells.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
