OL,3,GNEWSA'We're going through half a kilo
OL,4,Aof rat poison a week'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bradford Council spokesperson said
OL,7,Fthe latest report of fly-tipping in the
OL,8,Farea had come in "a couple of days ago
OL,9,Fand the majority of waste was removed
OL,10,Fimmediately".
